# Handle

The README, docs, comments, and path examples name a person only as the handle `decnet100`.

Any other personal name, email address, or Windows user folder in those places is replaced with `decnet100`.

```text
cd C:\Users\decnet100\Documents\privat\alpine-roadtrip
```
